Package: qPCRtools
Authors@R: person('Xiang', 'LI', email = 'lixiang117423@gmail.com', role = c('cre', 'aut'))
Version: 1.1.0
Title: Tools for qPCR
Description: Provides tools for quantitative PCR (qPCR) data analysis,
    including standard curve calculation with amplification efficiency,
    expression level calculation using multiple methods (2-dCt, 2-ddCt,
    standard curve, and RqPCR), and RNA volume calculation for
    reverse transcription.
URL: https://github.com/lixiang117423/qPCRtools
BugReports: https://github.com/lixiang117423/qPCRtools/issues
